Pikku licensing
===============

Copyright (c) 2021 - present Yasser Fadl and Pikku contributors

This repository is deliberately mixed. Every package ships its own LICENSE file;
that file governs the package. This file is only a map.

AGPL-3.0-only (GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
  @pikku/cli            packages/cli
  @pikku/inspector      packages/inspector
  @pikku/inspector-go   packages/inspector-go
  pikku-inspect-rs      packages/inspector-rust   (Rust inspector, not published)

  Packages that depend on or import the CLI or the inspectors are AGPL too:
  @pikku/addon-console      packages/addon/pikku-console
  @pikku/code-edit          packages/code-edit
  @pikku/n8n-import         packages/n8n-import
  @pikku/addon-changes-cli  packages/addon/pikku-changes-cli  (not published)
  @pikku/addon-cloud-cli    packages/addon/pikku-cloud-cli    (not published)

  The full text is in scripts/licenses/AGPL-3.0 and in each package's LICENSE.

  packages/inspector-go/internal/tsjg is a port of ts-json-schema-generator and
  keeps its own MIT notice (packages/inspector-go/internal/tsjg/LICENSE).

MIT
---
  Everything else: @pikku/core, the runtimes, the services, the clients
  (@pikku/fetch, @pikku/websocket), @pikku/react, @pikku/vite, the other addons
  (@pikku/addon-*), @pikku/skills, @pikku/knowledge, create-pikku and every
  other package. The text is in scripts/licenses/MIT and in each package's
  LICENSE.

