Other licensing
---------------
  If the AGPL-3.0 does not work for you, other licensing is available.
  See LICENSE-COMMERCIAL.md.

Releases published before this change keep the licence they were published
under (Business Source License 1.1 for @pikku/cli, @pikku/inspector,
@pikku/inspector-go and @pikku/console).
